#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID does not expose separate end-user registration and login products. Hosted Auth starts from the same identifier step and decides login or user creation from organization policy and account state."
msgstr "XID no expone productos separados para registro e inicio de sesión de usuarios finales. Hosted Auth empieza desde el mismo paso de identificador y decide entre inicio de sesión o creación de usuario según la política de la organización y el estado de la cuenta."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID exposes inbound SCIM Service Provider endpoints for external IdPs. Downstream SaaS SCIM push clients have local fake-SaaS evidence, but production support still requires real SaaS admin L4."
msgstr "ES: XID exposes inbound SCIM Service Provider endpoints for external IdPs. Downstream SaaS SCIM push clients have local fake-SaaS evidence, but production support still requires real SaaS admin L4."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID exposes organization-scoped SCIM 2.0 APIs under <0>/scim/v2/organizations/{organization_id}</0>. User and group resources are addressed with the organization ID in the path."
msgstr "XID expone API SCIM 2.0 con alcance de organización en <0>/scim/v2/organizations/{organization_id}</0>. Los recursos de usuarios y grupos se direccionan con el ID de organización en la ruta."

#: apps/server/src/lib/page-seo-messages.ts
msgid "XID is an edge-native identity platform for OIDC, OAuth, organization RBAC, enterprise SSO, SCIM, passkeys, and networkless JWT verification on Cloudflare."
msgstr "XID es una plataforma de identidad edge nativa para OIDC, OAuth, RBAC organizacional, SSO empresarial, SCIM, passkeys y verificación JWT sin red en Cloudflare.organizacional, SSO empresarial, SCIM, passkeys y verificación JWT sin red en Cloudflare.organizacional, SSO empresarial, SCIM, passkeys y verificación JWT sin red en Cloudflare."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID is an identity provider. The instance domain is the OIDC issuer, API base URL, Hosted Auth base URL, and console base URL. Organizations provide policy, branding, membership, and resource isolation."
msgstr "XID es un proveedor de identidad. El dominio de la instancia es el emisor OIDC, la URL base de API, la URL base de Hosted Auth y la URL base de la consola. Las organizaciones aportan política, marca, membresía y aislamiento de recursos."

#: apps/server/src/routes/home/HeroSection.tsx
#~ msgid "XID is an OIDC / OAuth identity provider with explicit support levels, organization RBAC, provider-ready enterprise SAML/OIDC federation, inbound SCIM, local downstream SaaS SAML and SCIM baselines, and Web, Backend, React, and Next.js SDKs. It runs on Cloudflare's global network, while real provider and SaaS production support remains tied to L4 evidence instead of local mock runs."
#~ msgstr "ES: XID is an OIDC / OAuth identity provider with explicit support levels, organization RBAC, provider-ready enterprise SAML/OIDC federation, inbound SCIM, local downstream SaaS SAML and SCIM baselines, and Web, Backend, React, and Next.js SDKs. It runs on Cloudflare's global network, while real provider and SaaS production support remains tied to L4 evidence instead of local mock runs."

#: apps/server/src/routes/home/PlatformSection.tsx
